 she out to  unmake and  unseat vaude as the world's premier home  base of superheroes is she just a pure  super villain trying to sow chaos  we don't know but we do know she's  dangerous in more ways than one  in the wake of stormfront's defeat the  boys go their separate ways  huey is happy to stay with annie and try  to make the relationship work in a more  stable environment and eager to let go  of the chapter in his life where he  seemed to live  between two worlds little does he know  though that he seems to be on the verge  of living some kind of double life yet  again  the last thing we see him do in season  two is sign up for a job  in congresswoman newman's office and  while that might not necessarily put him  right in the thick of suit battles again  it does put him right next to one of the  most dangerous soups on the planet  how long until he realizes he's been  wrapped up in another super scheme  will butcher and the boys come calling  if they realize what newman really is  either way it's clear that huey is  already on the verge of getting pulled  right back into a world he was eager to  leave  one of the defining arcs of the boys has  been the gradual breakup of the original  stable lineup of the seven as we saw it  at the beginning of season one  starlight's edition was supposed to be  the only major replacement after the  retirement of lamplighter but since then  homelander has struggled to hold his  super team together  as the series goes on both the deep and  a train are gone  starlight is full on rebelling and maeve  is beginning to have second thoughts  near the end of season two it looked  like the only loyalists left in the  group were the newcomer stormfront  and the silent enforcer black noir now  both of those allies are seriously  incapacitated  maeve takes noir out by feeding him an  almond joy activating a tree nut allergy  that may not have killed him  but has at least left him nearly brain  dead with no real prognosis  as for stormfront she's still alive but  she's been left  limbless and outed as a literal nazi  suffice it to say the seven will look  very different again in season three  season two of the boys featured a lot of  minor arcs on top of the major ones  and one that paid off in a hilariously  twisted way by the season finale was the  dual redemption journey of the deep  and a train both were expelled from the  seven for different reasons over the  course of the first two seasons  and both hoped to leverage the influence  of the church of the collective to get  back in bots good graces  of course it didn't go quite the way we  may have thought  one other thing you uh you ripped your  best  what your gill is showing  cover it up it's disgusting the deep  spent all season making sacrifices  changing his behavior and doing what he  was told by the church in the hope that  the seven would see the light  then at the 11th hour a train steals  church files on stormfront and leaks  them to the boys  getting her ousted and by extension  impressing church leadership and vaught  with his initiative  so while atrain is now back in the  seventh the deep is left once again  without a home base  continuing to fail no matter what he  tries when the dust settles a lot of  things are different setting the stage  for a third season that will probably be  even more unpredictable than the first  two  among the big changes courtesy of grace  mallory is that the boys are free men  because they helped take down stormfront  all charges against them have been  dropped  and they've even got the opportunity to  join a newly established office to keep  an eye on supes if they want it  for now none of the boys with the  possible exception of huey seem to want  that job  butcher is grieving mm has returned to  his family and frenchie and kimiko are  off to try and build a life together  huey's attempt to land a job with  congresswoman newman might get him a  position in the government office  eventually but for the moment we've seen  the end of the boys  at least until another soup threat  brings them back together  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite shows are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one
 

